  "verseCount": 41,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "NUM 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balak Summons Balaam",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the Israelites traveled to the plains of Moab and camped along the Jordan across from Jericho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now Balak son of Zippor saw all that Israel had done to the Amorites,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Moab was terrified because there were so many people. Indeed, Moab was filled with dread because of the Israelites.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Moabites said to the elders of Midian, \"This horde is going to lick up everything around us, as an ox licks up the grass of the field.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "NUM 22:4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "So Balak son of Zippor, who was king of Moab at that time,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sent messengers to summon Balaam son of Beor, who was at Pethor, near the Euphrates River, in his native land. Balak said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm",
        "vid": "NUM 22:5"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"A people has come out of Egypt; they cover the face of the land and have settled next to me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now come and put a curse on these people, because they are too powerful for me. Perhaps then I will be able to defeat them and drive them out of the land. For I know that whoever you bless is blessed, and whoever you curse is cursed.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The elders of Moab and Midian left, taking with them the fee for divination. When they came to Balaam, they told him what Balak had said.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Spend the night here,\" Balaam said to them, \"and I will report back to you with the answer the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.22.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.22.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gives me.\" So the Moabite officials stayed with him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God came to Balaam and asked, \"Who are these men with you?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaam said to God, \"Balak son of Zippor, king of Moab, sent me this message:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'A people that has come out of Egypt covers the face of the land. Now come and put a curse on them for me. Perhaps then I will be able to fight them and drive them away.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God said to Balaam, \"Do not go with them. You must not put a curse on those people, because they are blessed.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The next morning Balaam got up and said to Balak's officials, \"Go back to your own country, for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.22.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.22.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has refused to let me go with you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So the Moabite officials returned to Balak and said, \"Balaam refused to come with us.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then Balak sent other officials, more numerous and more distinguished than the first.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "They came to Balaam and said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "pm",
        "vid": "NUM 22:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\"This is what Balak son of Zippor says: Do not let anything keep you from coming to me,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "because I will reward you handsomely and do whatever you say. Come and put a curse on these people for me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Balaam answered them, \"Even if Balak gave me all the silver and gold in his palace, I could not do anything great or small to go beyond the command of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.22.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.22.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "my God.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Now spend the night here so that I can find out what else the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.22.19",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.22.19"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will tell me.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "That night God came to Balaam and said, \"Since these men have come to summon you, go with them, but do only what I tell you.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Balaam's Donkey",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaam got up in the morning, saddled his donkey and went with the Moabite officials.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But God was very angry when he went, and the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.22.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.22.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "stood in the road to oppose him. Balaam was riding on his donkey, and his two servants were with him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the donkey saw the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.22.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.22.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "standing in the road with a drawn sword in his hand, it turned off the road into a field. Balaam beat it to get it back on the road.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the angel of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "NUM.22.24",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "NUM.22.24"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "stood in a narrow path through the vineyards, with walls on both sides.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
